title: Under the Alps
text: A MOBILE TELEPORTER is a teleporter you place yourself. Light entering one jumps ahead to the next teleporter in its direction of travel, so two of them make a tunnel through anything in between, in any direction.
trick: two mobile teleporters, one on each side of the mountain, form a tunnel
motif: snowy mountain with a railway tunnel through it
---
